{
  "schema": 1,
  "_help": "Registry tweaks for the OFFLINE image. hive: SOFTWARE = HKLM\\SOFTWARE, SYSTEM = HKLM\\SYSTEM, NTUSER = Users\\Default\\NTUSER.DAT (every new user), DEFAULT = Windows\\System32\\config\\DEFAULT (.DEFAULT profile). os = win10 | win11 | both; level = safe | aggressive; default = ticked in the GUI / used by the console. set = values to write, deleteKey = keys to delete, deleteValue = values to delete; undo = how to restore the Windows default. bootWim = true: bootSet is also written to boot.wim index 2 (Windows Setup). minBuild / maxBuild (optional) limit the builds.",
